+            // no final store can overwrite the slot afterwards. The planted scored entry is shallower than the
+            // search (depth 0 or 1 < 2), so it is a hit that does not cut off: the node reaches the P17 site
+            // with tt_hit = true. A control run with EvalOnlyStore=0 first proves the window really has no final
